"entity": {
"name": "RPM International Incorporated",
"description": "RPM International, Inc. engages in the manufacture, marketing, and sale of coatings, sealants, building materials, and related services. It operates through the following segments: Construction Products Group (CPG), Performance Coatings Group (PCG), and Consumer Group. The CPG segment refers to construction sealants and adhesives, coatings and chemicals, roofing systems, concrete admixture and repair products, building envelope solutions, insulated cladding, flooring systems, and weatherproofing solutions. The PCG segment focuses on flooring solutions, corrosion control and fireproofing coatings, infrastructure repair systems, fiberglass reinforced plastic gratings and drainage systems. The Consumer Group segment includes rust-preventative, special purpose, and decorative paints, caulks, sealants, primers, cement cleaners, floor sealers and woodcare coatings, sandpaper and other abrasives, and other branded consumer products. The company was founded by Frank C. Sullivan in May 1947 and is headquartered in Medina, OH.",
"rbics_econ": "Non-Energy Materials",
"rbics_sector": "Chemical, Plastic and Rubber Materials",
"rbics_subsector": "Specialty and Performance Chemicals",
"rbics_indgrp": "Adhesive, Sealant, Coating and Paint Products",
"country_of_risk": "US"
